i2"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.record-257hg-i2"],"id":"long.record-257hg-i2","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Theorem 6.118 (The unweighted sum of remaining gap lengths)","locator":"Long record Theorem 6.118, p. 77, label record:257hg-i2","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*For every $N\\ge0$, the unweighted sum of gap lengths satisfies\n$$\n\\sum_{n>N}g_n\\le\\frac29\\,4^{-N}+\\frac37\\,8^{-N},\n$$\nwhich tends to zero. The estimate follows by summing the per-level bound; it counts one length per level. It does not, by itself, bound the measure of the union of all gaps, because there are $2^{n-1}$ disjoint translated gaps at level $n$.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257hg-i2","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257hg-i2","id":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.record-257hg-i2%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.mersenneGap_le%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.record-257hg-i2%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.mersenneGap_le%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/lean.Erdos249257.mersenneGap_le"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257hg-i2","id":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.record-257hg-i2%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.mersenneGap_tail_le%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.record-257hg-i2%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.mersenneGa